IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-PULSECHAIN-CACHE-INVARIANCE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-QUERIES PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NETWORK-FETCHES PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 DISTINCT-KEYS PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 FORCED-REFRESHES PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 CACHE-LATENCY-NS PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 K-EXPONENT PIC 9 USAGE R5.
01 STATUS-CODE PIC 9 USAGE R6.
01 EXPECTED-FETCHES PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 3 TO K-EXPONENT.
    PERFORM VERIFY-CACHE-INVARIANCE.
    IF STATUS-CODE == 0
        SET depth 5.
    ELSE
        SET depth 1.
    END-IF.
    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

VERIFY-CACHE-INVARIANCE.
    IF K-EXPONENT != 3
        MOVE 1 TO STATUS-CODE
        EXIT.
    END-IF.
    COMPUTE EXPECTED-FETCHES = DISTINCT-KEYS + FORCED-REFRESHES.
    IF NETWORK-FETCHES != EXPECTED-FETCHES
        MOVE 2 TO STATUS-CODE
        EXIT.
    END-IF.
    IF CACHE-LATENCY-NS >= 1000
        MOVE 4 TO STATUS-CODE
        EXIT.
    END-IF.
    MOVE 0 TO STATUS-CODE.
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
